%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4877fb6ffc62fe90d83c8e4d3d4cb55f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 05_Chapter5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  storyId: story_main_05
  storyName: An Unprofitable Encounter
  storyDescription: 'Battle: Tren and Trady. Twice. Reward: Bokusu joins the roster.'
  chapterLabel: CHAPTER 5
  previousStory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ee80f1694c103f3a8ade00d19956f4b, type: 2}
  requiredLevel: {fileID: 0}
  storyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  segments:
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The group continues traveling through the Concept World.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar has started to get used to the strange surroundings. He still doesn't
        understand how this world works, but at least he knows the creatures around
        him aren't ordinary people.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Noz, can I ask you something?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Certainly, Your Majesty.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You said every Concept Spirit represents something understood by humanity.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Correct.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Does that mean there are Concept Spirits for everything?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Not necessarily everything. But many things that humanity understands
        can have a representation here.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Even something as specific as a phone?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HEY!!! THAT'S ME!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yes. Although the nature and relevance of each concept differ considerably.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: And what happens when people stop understanding something?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Its relevance may change. But that is a more complicated subject.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...I see.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: OH!!! LOOK!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Two Concept Spirits are standing nearby.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh? What's this?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A new face?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well, well. Isn't this interesting?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Who are you?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Tren. Trend, if you prefer the full name.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: And I'm Trady. Trade.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Are you two together?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Not exactly.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We simply happen to share an interest in seeing how things turn out.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's reassuring.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So you're the new King?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Apparently.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I've heard quite a lot about you.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Hopefully nothing embarrassing.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh, nothing particularly interesting yet.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Let's see what you can do.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your Majesty, I would advise caution.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Why?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Their concepts are not particularly easy to deal with.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Awww. Don't be so serious.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We only want to see whether our new King is worth the attention.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THEY LOOK STRONG!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You keep saying that.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: BECAUSE THEY KEEP LOOKING STRONG!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Let's have some fun!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    level: {fileID: 0}
    team: []
    scriptedLoss: 0
    scriptedLossSeconds: 45
    battleToasts: []
  - type: 1
    lines: []
    level: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c6fdbd8c77594199fb8e0473567e673c, type: 2}
    team:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    scriptedLoss: 1
    scriptedLossSeconds: 45
    battleToasts:
    - time: 2
      trigger: 0
      notBefore: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      text: THEY'RE REALLY STRONG!!! JUST SURVIVE!!!
      duration: 4.5
    - time: 13
      trigger: 0
      notBefore: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      text: Awww, is that all you've got?
      duration: 4.5
    - time: 27
      trigger: 0
      notBefore: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      text: What a disappointing performance. I expected more from the new King.
      duration: 4.5
    - time: 38
      trigger: 0
      notBefore: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      text: Stay focused, Your Majesty. Don't let them overwhelm you.
      duration: 4.5
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The battle ends in defeat.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar and his party barely manage to stand. Tren and Trady don't seem
        particularly impressed.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...We lost.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THEY'RE REALLY STRONG!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I noticed.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Their attacks are too overwhelming for our current formation.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So what do we do?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We need a way to withstand their attacks.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A small box-shaped Spirit approaches.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...You look like you could use a shield.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: And you are?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Bokusu. Box.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: FINALLY!!! SOMEONE WHO CAN KEEP US ALIVE!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's... technically my job.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You're a Protector?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Correct. I can create a barrier to protect the active unit.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Can you protect the whole party?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Not directly. My barrier protects whoever is currently active.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That should be enough to give us some breathing room.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So we can use your barrier when things get dangerous, then switch to
        another character?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Exactly. But don't rely on it forever. It has limited durability and
        duration.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: WE HAVE A BOX NOW!!! WE'RE UNSTOPPABLE!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I wouldn't go that far.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Let's try again.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Are you sure?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We won't get anywhere if we keep running away.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Then I'll do my best to protect everyone.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Tren and Trady are still nearby.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh? You're trying again?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: How persistent.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We're not finished.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: How admirable.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 861c91e0066ee5902b97918f4a0a639a, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Let's see how long you last this time!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    level: {fileID: 0}
    team: []
    scriptedLoss: 0
    scriptedLossSeconds: 45
    battleToasts: []
  - type: 1
    lines: []
